  "instructions": [
    {
      "primary_message": "In a cup, add 2 tsp espresso powder to 8 fl oz of hot water, then stir to combine the espresso.\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Transfer espresso to a shallow dish and let cool. \n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Once cool, dip 1 Quaker® lightly salted rice cake into the espresso for 1 second per side. Transfer rice cake to the center of an individual serving plate, spread with 1 tablespoon of Nutella®. Dip another rice cake in coffee for 1 second per side, then stack on the first topped rice cake. Spread with 4 tablespoons of vanilla yogurt. Repeat to make another single serving. \t\t\t\t\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Dust each serving with 1/2 teaspoon of espresso powder.\t\t\t\t\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Serve and enjoy!\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "CHEF'S TIP: You can also use unsweetened cocoa powder for dusting the tops of the rice cakes.\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
  ],
